<title>LATVIA: TRASTA Q1 PROFIT 489,000 LATS VS 30,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>TRASTA Q1 PROFIT 489,000 LATS VS 30,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trasta Bank, the fourteenth largest Latvian bank by assets, said on Thursday that its 1997 first quarter profit was 489,000 lats against 30,948 lats for the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its own capital was 3.23 million lats at the end of March against 1.47 million lats for the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank's assets were 20.66 million lats in the first quarter versus 10.98 million lats in the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
